        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edward H. Griffith, Edward Burns\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, producer, actor, writer\n- Films: Saving Private Ryan, 15 Minutes, Life or Something Like It, A Sound of Thunder, The Holiday, One Missed Call, 27 Dresses, Man on a Ledge, Friends with Kids, Alex Cross\n\nFacts:\n- Edward H. Griffith was born on August 23, 1888, and he was an American motion picture director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Edward H. Griffith was also known as E H Griffith, Lieut. Edward H. Griffith, Edward Griffith, and E. H. Griffith.\n- Edward H. Griffith died on March 3, 1975.\n- Edward Burns was born on January 29, 1968, and his full name is Edward Fitzgerald Burns.\n- Edward Burns is an American actor, film producer, writer, and director.\n- Edward Burns is best known for appearing in the films Saving Private Ryan (1998), 15 Minutes (2001), Life or Something Like It (2002), A Sound of Thunder (2005), The Holiday (2006), One Missed Call (2008), 27 Dresses (2008), Man on a Ledge (2012), Friends with Kids (2012), and Alex Cross (2012).",
